 richness of the libraries, and the widespread practice of Islamic worship. All this seems to have been facilitated by the use of the local language, Pular, as a medium of teaching and popularization of Islamic rules and doctrine." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2741, 'temperature': 0.2})
